 "title": "八个误解",
 "pill": 4,
 "total": 160.6,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg4-00",
   "text": "下面是最容易误解的 8 个语言特性。每个都看三件事：误解，事实，影响。",
   "spoken": "下面是最容易误解的 8 个语言特性。每个都看三件事：误解，事实，影响。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg4-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 7.656,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 8.421
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-01",
   "text": "一，private。误解是别人看不到。",
   "spoken": "一，private。误解是别人看不到。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg4-01.mp3",
   "start": 9.476,
   "dur": 4.344,
   "speechStart": 9.574,
   "speechEnd": 12.988
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-02",
   "text": "事实是，它只限制其他合约来调用，存储完全公开。所以不能存秘密。",
   "spoken": "事实是，它只限制其他合约来掉用，存储完全公开。所以不能存秘密。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg4-02.mp3",
   "start": 14.04,
   "dur": 7.272,
   "speechStart": 14.138,
   "speechEnd": 20.469
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-03",
   "text": "二，receive 和 fallback。误解是，转账只是改个余额。",
   "spoken": "二，receive 和 fallback。误解是，转账只是改个余额。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg4-03.mp3",
   "start": 21.532,
   "dur": 5.808,
   "speechStart": 21.63,
   "speechEnd": 26.52
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-04",
   "text": "事实是，向合约转 ETH，会执行它的代码。这就是重入的入口。",
   "spoken": "事实是，向合约转 ETH，会执行它的代码。这就是虫入的入口。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg4-04.mp3",
   "start": 27.56,
   "dur": 6.072,
   "speechStart": 27.658,
   "speechEnd": 32.798
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-05",
   "text": "三，selfdestruct。误解是它能删掉合约。",
   "spoken": "三，selfdestruct。误解是它能删掉合约。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg4-05.mp3",
   "start": 33.852,
   "dur": 4.8,
   "speechStart": 33.95,
   "speechEnd": 37.816
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-06",
   "text": "2024 年 Cancun 升级引入了 EIP-6780。之后，只有同一笔交易里创建的合约，才会被删除。其他情况，只转走余额。",
   "spoken": "2024 年 Cancun 升级引入了 EIP-6780。之后，只有同一笔交易里创建的合约，才会被删除。其他情况，只转走余额。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg4-06.mp3",
   "start": 38.872,
   "dur": 12.12,
   "speechStart": 38.97,
   "speechEnd": 50.158
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-07",
   "text": "四，合约余额。误解是，只能通过我的函数增加。",
   "spoken": "四，合约余额。误解是，只能通过我的函数增加。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg4-07.mp3",
   "start": 51.212,
   "dur": 5.784,
   "speechStart": 51.31,
   "speechEnd": 56.164
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-08",
   "text": "事实是，任何人都能强制转入。比如 selfdestruct，比如出块奖励地址。",
   "spoken": "事实是，任何人都能强制转入。比如 selfdestruct，比如出块奖励地址。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg4-08.mp3",
   "start": 57.216,
   "dur": 7.68,
   "speechStart": 57.314,
   "speechEnd": 64.049
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-09",
   "text": "所以，拿合约自己的余额来记账，会被一笔捐赠打乱。",
   "spoken": "所以，拿合约自己的余额来记账，会被一笔捐赠打乱。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg4-09.mp3",
   "start": 65.116,
   "dur": 5.52,
   "speechStart": 65.214,
   "speechEnd": 69.785
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-10",
   "text": "五，检查型算术。0.8 版以后，溢出会回滚。",
   "spoken": "五，检查型算术。0.8 版以后，溢出会回滚。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg4-10.mp3",
   "start": 70.856,
   "dur": 5.568,
   "speechStart": 70.954,
   "speechEnd": 75.594
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-11",
   "text": "但 unchecked 块，类型转换，除法截断，都不会报错。",
   "spoken": "但 unchecked 块，类型转换，除法截断，都不会报错。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg4-11.mp3",
   "start": 76.644,
   "dur": 5.256,
   "speechStart": 76.742,
   "speechEnd": 81.051
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-12",
   "text": "六，block.timestamp。它不是精确时间。",
   "spoken": "六，block.timestamp。它不是精确时间。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg4-12.mp3",
   "start": 82.12,
   "dur": 4.536,
   "speechStart": 82.218,
   "speechEnd": 85.81
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-13",
   "text": "出块者可以在小范围内改动它，L2 上由排序器决定。不能拿它做随机数，也不能做秒级判断。",
   "spoken": "出块者可以在小范围内改动它，L2 上由排序器决定。不能拿它做随机数，也不能做秒级判断。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg4-13.mp3",
   "start": 86.876,
   "dur": 8.76,
   "speechStart": 86.974,
   "speechEnd": 94.793
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-14",
   "text": "七，block.number。误解是，每个块的时间固定。",
   "spoken": "七，block.number。误解是，每个块的时间固定。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg4-14.mp3",
   "start": 95.856,
   "dur": 5.112,
   "speechStart": 95.954,
   "speechEnd": 100.13
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-15",
   "text": "BSC 在 2026 年 1 月的 Fermi 升级后，出块时间从 3 秒缩到了 0.45 秒。L2 上的含义，因链而异。",
   "spoken": "BSC 在 2026 年 1 月的 Fermi 升级后，出块时间从 3 秒缩到了 0.45 秒。L2 上的含义，因链而异。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg4-15.mp3",
   "start": 101.188,
   "dur": 9.648,
   "speechStart": 101.286,
   "speechEnd": 110.009
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-16",
   "text": "用区块数来算利息或锁定期，就会出错。",
   "spoken": "用区块数来算利息或锁定期，就会出错。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg4-16.mp3",
   "start": 111.056,
   "dur": 4.44,
   "speechStart": 111.154,
   "speechEnd": 114.654
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-17",
   "text": "八，函数选择器。误解是，函数名就是唯一的身份。",
   "spoken": "八，函数选择器。误解是，函数名就是唯一的身份。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg4-17.mp3",
   "start": 115.716,
   "dur": 6.0,
   "speechStart": 115.814,
   "speechEnd": 120.883
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-18",
   "text": "事实是，选择器只取哈希的前 4 字节，不同的函数签名，可能撞在一起。",
   "spoken": "事实是，选择器只取哈希的前 4 字节，不同的函数签名，可能撞在一起。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg4-18.mp3",
   "start": 121.936,
   "dur": 6.936,
   "speechStart": 122.034,
   "speechEnd": 128.034
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-19",
   "text": "2021 年 8 月的 Poly Network 事故，关键一步就在这里，损失约 6.1 亿美元。",
   "spoken": "2021 年 8 月的 Poly Network 事故，关键一步就在这里，损失约 6.1 亿美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg4-19.mp3",
   "start": 129.092,
   "dur": 6.456,
   "speechStart": 129.19,
   "speechEnd": 134.713
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-20",
   "text": "按公开复盘，一个构造出来的函数名，撞上了替换验证者公钥的那个函数。",
   "spoken": "按公开复盘，一个构造出来的函数名，撞上了替换验证者公钥的那个函数。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg4-20.mp3",
   "start": 135.768,
   "dur": 6.84,
   "speechStart": 135.866,
   "speechEnd": 141.77
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-21",
   "text": "审计时还要盯住一对词：storage 和 memory。",
   "spoken": "审计时还要盯住一对词：storage 和 memory。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg4-21.mp3",
   "start": 142.828,
   "dur": 4.68,
   "speechStart": 142.926,
   "speechEnd": 146.687
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-22",
   "text": "storage 是引用，改了会写回。memory 是副本，改了不写回。",
   "spoken": "storage 是引用，改了会写回。memory 是副本，改了不写回。",
